Fail loudly when a kmem claim does not fit

kernel_map carries wait_for_space for the ipc copy map, so vm_map_locate_space
sleeps in thread_block() with nothing alive to wake it.  Clear the flag for the
call and restore it.  The panic path cannot print this early (the console reports
gPanicBase is still not initialized), so report the failing claim and the return
code with printf before panicking.
---
